scale = Vector2(0.77, 0.77)
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.05799634, 0.057996355, 0.05799631, 1)
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("14_ei412")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 25
text = "We successfully transferred Subject-06
to one of the  containment cells.
It's strange how a mother can report her
own daughter.
Subject-06 spent some time in a psychiatric
hospital, and all her information was there:
address, name, family records, everything.
Finding her was easier than expected.
She will be an excellent subject for further
observation and experimentation.

We still have no sign of the others.
Except for Subject-01.
He remains active somewhere in the city.
According to the reports, he was the one
who started all of this. Patient Zero.
Containment has failed.
The city is gone.
And what remains of it?
Only memories of what was once a city.

May God have mercy on us."

